 "notes": "Section 10.1 in Notice 2 supersedes Sections 10.1 to 10.20 of Revision F. Page 10-6 (PDF page 40) is a worked example in Section 10.2: a CQ capacitor at 50 C, 0.015 microfarads, voltage stress 0.68, ground fixed, non-established reliability quality, giving lambda_p = 0.049 failures/10^6 hours. The handbook prints the pi_Q row for established reliability level S and B together (S,B = 0.03); both keys are listed here. pi_C and pi_V in the worked example were taken from the printed equations, not from linear interpolation of the tables."
